<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT -  TriMas started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT -  TriMas started as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers analyst Donald Zwyer has started coverage of TriMas Corp with a rating of buy.</p>
<p>-- In an April 29 report, Zwyer set a $30 price target on the stock, based on 15 times estimated 1998 earnings of $1.95 a share.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the Ann Arbor, Mich., diversified manufacturer were up 1/8 to 24-5/8 in late morning trade.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street Desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
</text>
